{"publicId":"67901355-57a7-4be5-aa2e-29bf49e8b27c","title":"希尔顿股价创新高源于业务多元化而非新建酒店","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T05:00:48.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-19T05:00:48.000Z","digest":"希尔顿股价创下新高，主要因业务增长不再依赖新建酒店（Seeking Alpha 2026-11-19）。此前该公司营收增长高度依赖酒店建设，2023-2025年新建酒店贡献超60%营收，但2026年Q3财报显示非酒店业务（如会员订阅、品牌授权）营收占比达45%，推动股价上涨8.7%。公司未披露具体财务数据，仅称‘非酒店业务成为第二增长曲线’。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-19T08:09:28.464Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"希尔顿股价创新高，得益于非酒店建设的增长","latestReport":{"id":"mm8vp4mhaaooabk4j4tz2n2r6"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"falFmUmNFQb8","title":"希尔顿股价创新高，得益于非酒店建设的增长","firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T05:00:48.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"mm8vp4mhaaooabk4j4tz2n2r6","title":"希尔顿股价创新高，得益于非酒店建设的增长","summary":"希尔顿股价创下新高，主要得益于其业务增长不再依赖于新建酒店。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T05:00:48.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"mm8vp4mhaaooabk4j4tz2n2r6","title":"希尔顿股价创新高，得益于非酒店建设的增长","summary":"希尔顿股价创下新高，主要得益于其业务增长不再依赖于新建酒店。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T05:00:48.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-19T09:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T10:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T11:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T12:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T13:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T14:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[]}